•modifications to Consolidated EBITDA (as defined); and

•modifications and additions to affirmative covenants.

As a result of entering into Amendment No. 3, the Company capitalized $1,590 of deferred financing costs and wrote off $182 of previously recorded deferred financing costs during the six months ended June 30, 2026.

